  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> be a relation on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>N</mi></math> defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; if and only if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "symmetric but neither reflexive nor transitive",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "transitive but neither reflexive nor symmetric",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "reflexive and symmetric but not transitive",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "symmetric and transitive but not reflexive",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8660;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><strong>Reflexive:</strong></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>It is false. So, given relation is not reflexive.</p><p><strong>Symmetric:</strong></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>It is symmetric.</p><p>Transitive:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mi>R</mi></menclose><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, not transitive.</p>"
  }
}